title: Campfire Tale
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: scholar

scholar: Sit. I'll tell you about the last one who came through here.
scholar: They got further than you'd think. Kept a page from every monster they beat. Called it their tome.
seeker: What happened to them?
scholar: Ran out of pages. Here, take this. It's the one they left me.

